                <note rend="inline" type="source">783.003/272: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Egypt</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Fish</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Alexandria</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-07-21T19:00:00+02:00">July 21, 1937—7
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received July 22—5:39 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>59. Egyptian Parliament approved ratifications of the Montreux Convention last
                    night.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fish</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
